WEBVTT

00:19:56.710 --> 00:20:00.240
Ons sal misluk en ander ook.

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:03.810
Maar dis ’n ideaal om na te streef.

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:05.220
Dankie.

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:10.000
(Applous)

00:20:11.870 --> 00:20:13.210
Blink oë!

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:15.930
Blink oë!

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:20.620
(Applous)

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:24.530
Dankie, dankie.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:25.603
(Applous)